  "final": "Implemented lazy, exactly-once cleanup for started streams. Read and transform errors remain primary if cleanup also fails; otherwise cleanup errors propagate.\n\n`take` now closes its iterator on completion, early exit, or failure. A zero limit leaves the stream untouched.\n\nVerification passed:\n- `python3 checks/public.py`\n- `python3 checks/lifecycle.py`",
